'''Tondano''', officially the '''Republic of Tondano''' (Tondani: Republic Tondano), is a [[w:Sovereign state|sovereign state]] situated in the northeastern [[Fosia]] in the [[Balausia Peninsula]] and north coast of [[Jade Sea]], also includes various small archipelagoes situated on the northern Jade Sea. Bordering [[Pangkajene]] in west and [[Dagit]] in east, Tondano has its roots heavily by the North fosian maritime culture, stretching from Nusaraya in west and Dagit in east, with [[Sultanate of Maros]] as the main influencer, together with [[Volisania|Volisanian]] influence from Dagit. Its capital city is [[Manandau]] and largest city is [[Marisa]]. Despite of its history rooted with dictator regime, Tondano is dubbed as the most developed country in Balausia Peninsula and Northeast Fosia in general with its Human Development Index rating 0.907.  
